WEBVTT

1
00:00:50.833 --> 00:00:50.875
In the third and fourth verses

2
00:00:50.875 --> 00:00:52.708
In the third and fourth verses

3
00:00:52.708 --> 00:00:54.250
of the eighth chapter,

4
00:00:54.250 --> 00:00:58.583
Lord Krishna is answering Arjuna's
 six important questions

5
00:00:58.583 --> 00:00:59.958
that were asked about

6
00:00:59.958 --> 00:01:02.291
Brahman, adhyātma, karma,

7
00:01:02.291 --> 00:01:03.875
adhibhūta, adhidaiva,

8
00:01:03.875 --> 00:01:07.208
and adhiyajña.

9
00:01:07.208 --> 00:01:08.000
These questions

10
00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.666
help us understand

11
00:01:09.666 --> 00:01:11.541
the fundamental principles

12
00:01:11.541 --> 00:01:13.416
of life and death.

13
00:01:13.416 --> 00:01:13.500
of life and death.

14
00:01:18.458 --> 00:01:19.708
In these verses,

15
00:01:19.708 --> 00:01:21.208
Lord Krishna answers

16
00:01:21.208 --> 00:01:24.041
Arjuna's questions about six

17
00:01:24.041 --> 00:01:25.833
important concepts.

18
00:01:25.833 --> 00:01:29.500
The first concept is Brahma!

19
00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:32.500
The jīvātmā is indestructible and spiritual,

20
00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:35.333
which shows its eternal nature.

21
00:01:35.333 --> 00:01:40.000
The jīva is Brahman, while
 Krishna is param Brahma.

22
00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:43.375
The second question is about adhyātma!

23
00:01:43.375 --> 00:01:45.458
Adhyātma shows the jīva's

24
00:01:45.458 --> 00:01:47.291
real nature,

25
00:01:47.291 --> 00:01:49.791
whose essence is to serve.

26
00:01:49.791 --> 00:01:51.708
Although in material consciousness,

27
00:01:51.708 --> 00:01:53.708
the soul wants dominance,

28
00:01:53.708 --> 00:01:56.583
wants ownership, but its spiritual

29
00:01:56.583 --> 00:02:00.625
nature is to serve paramātmā.

30
00:02:00.625 --> 00:02:03.833
The third question is about karma.

31
00:02:03.833 --> 00:02:06.875
Karma means all those actions

32
00:02:06.875 --> 00:02:11.375
that contribute to creating
 the jīva's material body

33
00:02:11.375 --> 00:02:12.458
and bind the soul

34
00:02:12.458 --> 00:02:15.000
in the cycle of birth and death.

35
00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:16.041
Actions inspired

36
00:02:16.041 --> 00:02:19.875
by material consciousness are called karma.

37
00:02:19.875 --> 00:02:24.166
The fourth curiosity is what is adhibhūta?

38
00:02:24.166 --> 00:02:25.750
Adhibhūta means

39
00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:29.291
continuously changing material nature.

40
00:02:29.291 --> 00:02:31.750
All material forms go through stages

41
00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:34.916
of birth, growth, and decay,

42
00:02:34.916 --> 00:02:38.916
which highlight their temporary existence.

43
00:02:38.916 --> 00:02:43.000
The fifth eagerness is about adhidaiva.

44
00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:44.333
Adhidaiva is that universal

45
00:02:44.333 --> 00:02:48.166
form of the Lord in which
 all deities are contained.

46
00:02:48.166 --> 00:02:49.166
This shows Krishna's vast

47
00:02:49.166 --> 00:02:51.083
presence in the universe

48
00:02:51.083 --> 00:02:55.000
and His control over all material elements.

49
00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:58.916
The sixth question is in the context of adhiyajña.

50
00:02:58.916 --> 00:02:59.875
Adhiyajña

51
00:02:59.875 --> 00:03:02.750
means Lord Krishna Himself!

52
00:03:02.750 --> 00:03:04.000
Who is the Supreme Lord

53
00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:04.916
and resides

54
00:03:04.916 --> 00:03:08.166
as paramātmā in every being.

55
00:03:08.166 --> 00:03:12.333
He is the ultimate enjoyer
 of all yajñas and worship.

56
00:03:12.333 --> 00:03:15.500
Material nature, deities, and yajña!

57
00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:17.541
Krishna is at the root of all.

58
00:03:17.541 --> 00:03:19.125
Understanding this essence,

59
00:03:19.125 --> 00:03:23.166
a person can go beyond material existence.

60
00:03:23.166 --> 00:03:25.458
This knowledge helps a person

61
00:03:25.458 --> 00:03:28.833
remember Lord Krishna at the time of death

62
00:03:28.833 --> 00:03:31.750
and takes forward on the path of liberation.

63
00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:33.541
Therefore, Krishna tells Arjuna

64
00:03:33.541 --> 00:03:37.458
to perform karma without attachment

65
00:03:37.458 --> 00:03:40.333
and focus entire attention only on paramātmā.

66
00:03:45.208 --> 00:03:49.916
As I explained in the explanation of adhibhūta

67
00:03:49.916 --> 00:03:53.458
about material nature being

68
00:03:53.458 --> 00:03:57.416
changeable,

69
00:03:57.416 --> 00:03:59.958
similarly the life

70
00:03:59.958 --> 00:04:05.791
around you is also continuously changeable.

71
00:04:05.791 --> 00:04:08.125
Your body, relationships,

72
00:04:08.125 --> 00:04:11.791
and circumstances continuously change.

73
00:04:11.791 --> 00:04:15.416
All these evolve, change,

74
00:04:15.416 --> 00:04:18.958
also end.

75
00:04:18.958 --> 00:04:20.708
I know that people

76
00:04:20.708 --> 00:04:21.625
fall into delusion

77
00:04:21.625 --> 00:04:23.541
of some person, thing, or circumstance,

78
00:04:23.541 --> 00:04:24.750
nurture desire

79
00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:29.041
to always remain with them.

80
00:04:29.041 --> 00:04:31.208
Just think –

81
00:04:31.208 --> 00:04:33.250
by denying this continuity of change

82
00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:38.666
and becoming deluded, only sorrow

83
00:04:38.666 --> 00:04:42.625
and depression will be obtained.

84
00:04:42.625 --> 00:04:45.000
Whatever is as it is in whichever moment,

85
00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:47.208
accept it as it is

86
00:04:47.208 --> 00:04:50.708
and welcome change,

87
00:04:50.708 --> 00:04:53.083
then your desires and delusion

88
00:04:53.083 --> 00:04:56.791
won't control you.

89
00:04:56.791 --> 00:04:59.166
Knowing success, failure,

90
00:04:59.166 --> 00:05:03.291
happiness-sorrow to all be temporary,

91
00:05:03.291 --> 00:05:05.916
you'll obtain life's joy

92
00:05:05.916 --> 00:05:08.916
while remaining unattached.

93
00:05:08.916 --> 00:05:11.583
By accepting the law of change,

94
00:05:11.583 --> 00:05:14.250
you learn not to fight with life

95
00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:18.833
but to flow with it.

96
00:05:18.833 --> 00:05:23.791
This doesn't mean at
 all that leaving everything,

97
00:05:23.791 --> 00:05:28.125
you sit with hands folded relying on fate,

98
00:05:28.125 --> 00:05:32.041
rather you focus on your spiritual development

99
00:05:32.041 --> 00:05:38.250
and your spiritual relationship with Me.

100
00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:41.541
When you focus on these two
 facts indestructible spiritual nature

101
00:05:41.541 --> 00:05:44.833
and your eternal relationship with Me –

102
00:05:44.833 --> 00:05:48.833
then you'll experience

103
00:05:48.833 --> 00:05:54.666
the permanence of such limitless peace

104
00:05:54.666 --> 00:05:57.333
like the North Star in the

105
00:05:57.333 --> 00:06:00.208
east direction! Permanent!

106
00:06:00.208 --> 00:06:04.250
Unchanging! Unwavering!

107
00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:05.458
This knowledge,

108
00:06:05.458 --> 00:06:07.250
this understanding keeps you free from 

109
00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:12.750
the influence of life's temporary ups and downs.

110
00:06:17.666 --> 00:06:20.250
Have you ever thought

111
00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:23.541
why members of the same family

112
00:06:23.541 --> 00:06:26.625
have different lives?

113
00:06:26.625 --> 00:06:28.833
This is because

114
00:06:28.833 --> 00:06:31.958
each member of the family's life

115
00:06:31.958 --> 00:06:36.166
depends on their karmas.

116
00:06:36.166 --> 00:06:38.583
It's very important to know

117
00:06:38.583 --> 00:06:40.583
that your circumstances

118
00:06:40.583 --> 00:06:45.625
are the fruit of your karmas.

119
00:06:45.625 --> 00:06:47.458
Each being –

120
00:06:47.458 --> 00:06:52.041
whether parents, children, or relatives –

121
00:06:52.041 --> 00:06:59.000
everyone's life is the result
 of their past done karmas.

122
00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:00.583
That's why

123
00:07:00.583 --> 00:07:02.750
someone is struggling a lot

124
00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:06.416
while someone is being very successful.

125
00:07:06.416 --> 00:07:08.708
The principle of karma

126
00:07:08.708 --> 00:07:11.583
always reminds that

127
00:07:11.583 --> 00:07:16.083
according to each one's karma,

128
00:07:16.083 --> 00:07:20.041
their circumstances turn in different ways.

129
00:07:20.041 --> 00:07:24.166
Someone's life is difficult, rough road,

130
00:07:24.166 --> 00:07:28.291
for someone smooth flat road.

131
00:07:28.291 --> 00:07:31.375
But always remember,

132
00:07:31.375 --> 00:07:34.875
I have created each one's life's journey

133
00:07:34.875 --> 00:07:38.458
with a special purpose.

134
00:07:38.458 --> 00:07:40.875
Every being, every soul –

135
00:07:40.875 --> 00:07:44.041
to learn, develop,

136
00:07:44.041 --> 00:07:46.000
and come near

137
00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:50.125
nature's true form.

138
00:07:50.125 --> 00:07:52.375
In different circumstances,

139
00:07:52.375 --> 00:07:54.791
instead of making comparisons,

140
00:07:54.791 --> 00:07:56.666
one should try to become

141
00:07:56.666 --> 00:07:59.333
each other's supporter.

142
00:07:59.333 --> 00:08:03.250
By stringing all family members

143
00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:06.791
in the thread of compassion, patience, and love,

144
00:08:06.791 --> 00:08:10.041
you make a garland of auspicious karmas,

145
00:08:10.041 --> 00:08:13.666
and every member of the family

146
00:08:13.666 --> 00:08:16.583
connects with mutual deep affection.

147
00:08:16.583 --> 00:08:18.791
When you accept

148
00:08:18.791 --> 00:08:20.833
that each person's life

149
00:08:20.833 --> 00:08:22.666
is for different purposes,

150
00:08:22.666 --> 00:08:24.291
their interests are different,

151
00:08:24.291 --> 00:08:28.250
and you respect those interests,

152
00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:32.041
then a wonderful harmony
 happens in the family,

153
00:08:32.041 --> 00:08:35.500
the atmosphere becomes very pleasant.

154
00:08:35.500 --> 00:08:39.125
You believe! Work done in the right direction

155
00:08:39.125 --> 00:08:43.583
and the feeling of taking care of all mutually

156
00:08:43.583 --> 00:08:46.416
creates a pleasant future.

157
00:08:46.416 --> 00:08:50.291
Not only for you

158
00:08:50.291 --> 00:08:51.916
but for the entire family.

159
00:08:56.875 --> 00:08:59.333
True leadership

160
00:08:59.333 --> 00:09:03.208
lies in serving others.

161
00:09:03.208 --> 00:09:05.333
Just like

162
00:09:05.333 --> 00:09:08.666
adhyātma! Meaning

163
00:09:08.666 --> 00:09:12.041
the soul's real nature!

164
00:09:12.041 --> 00:09:14.166
Which is to serve.

165
00:09:14.166 --> 00:09:17.833
In the business world, most people think

166
00:09:17.833 --> 00:09:19.750
that leadership means

167
00:09:19.750 --> 00:09:22.500
'becoming controller and giving orders,

168
00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:25.291
controlling everyone,'

169
00:09:25.291 --> 00:09:29.458
whereas true leadership's aspiration is

170
00:09:29.458 --> 00:09:34.208
the development of all people around you!

171
00:09:34.208 --> 00:09:38.875
The feeling of helping them
 in every circumstance!

172
00:09:38.875 --> 00:09:42.166
When you lead with spirit of service,

173
00:09:42.166 --> 00:09:45.416
then you not only develop yourself

174
00:09:45.416 --> 00:09:49.333
but also inspire people around you

175
00:09:49.333 --> 00:09:53.666
to make their best effort.

176
00:09:53.666 --> 00:09:57.333
As a leader, your role is

177
00:09:57.333 --> 00:09:59.833
that this feeling awakens

178
00:09:59.833 --> 00:10:03.166
in your organization's members –

179
00:10:03.166 --> 00:10:05.166
'True success isn't only

180
00:10:05.166 --> 00:10:07.708
in personal achievement,

181
00:10:07.708 --> 00:10:10.708
rather it's in such works

182
00:10:10.708 --> 00:10:13.708
through which your contribution can be

183
00:10:13.708 --> 00:10:17.208
in benefiting maximum people.'

184
00:10:17.208 --> 00:10:21.625
By serving others at your workplace,

185
00:10:21.625 --> 00:10:24.833
you create such an environment

186
00:10:24.833 --> 00:10:26.541
where each person

187
00:10:26.541 --> 00:10:30.291
not only experiences their meaningfulness

188
00:10:30.291 --> 00:10:31.500
but is also inspired

189
00:10:31.500 --> 00:10:35.375
to serve others themselves.

190
00:10:35.375 --> 00:10:40.500
In this way, you create such a work culture

191
00:10:40.500 --> 00:10:42.041
where naturally

192
00:10:42.041 --> 00:10:45.791
people become service-minded.

193
00:10:45.791 --> 00:10:48.958
You create such an organization

194
00:10:48.958 --> 00:10:51.375
that works coordinated by the spirit

195
00:10:51.375 --> 00:10:55.333
of unity and shared development.
